WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.800
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.200
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:24.040
You are my sun now

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:28.460
We all go through bad times

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:31.460
no matter who you are

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:36.890
So don't go hanging your head and feeling down

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:45.600
Keep your head up until your heart's sky

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:51.030
is clear again

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:56.360
No matter where you are in this world

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:59.870
if you're crying and trembling all alone

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:05.210
I'll search for you, I promise

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:08.880
Love will show me the way

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:16.720
The sun dreams countless times

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:23.560
Forever and always from the horizon

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:30.900
Its shining light gives energy

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:38.240
After all, you are my sun now

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:57.700
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:02.680
<i>I'm travelling with Jasmine and Barda to take back the gems that were stolen by the Shadow Lord.</i>

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:04.700
<i>And there are only two gems left!</i>

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:10.960
<i>However, the Shadow Lord is now hunting for a boy, a man and a wild girl with a black bird.</i>

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:15.310
<i>Why am I the 'wild one', anyway?
Honestly, the Shadow Lord has no taste.</i>

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:19.210
<i>Our journey is sure to become
more perilous from now on!</i>

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:24.610
<i>Right now, we're headed to the Maze of the Beast, where the sixth gem is hidden!</i>

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:38.000
The Glus is coming...

00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:02.800
As I thought. It uses those feeler tentacles to
sense movement, then attacks in that direction!

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:05.830
At this rate, we won't even get
the chance to search for the gem.

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:09.840
Jasmine, could you lend me your dagger?

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:11.490
Here.

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:12.780
Thank you.

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:18.580
Alright. I'll be a decoy and
attract the Glus' attention.

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:19.510
I will as well.

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:21.370
W-What about me...?

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:24.020
You can just go and hide somewhere.

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:50.320
Over here!

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:00.540
Lief!

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:21.020
Shit...!

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:26.850
Lief!

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:50.200
A dagger alone won't
be enough to hurt it...!

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:51.800
H-Hey!

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:53.050
Wait for me!

00:04:58.520 --> 00:04:59.600
In there!

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:08.560
Y-You sure this isn't a dead end...?

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.980
I think we might manage to get away.

00:05:10.980 --> 00:05:14.300
Surely that thing can't get
through a passage this narrow.

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:16.110
N-Neither can I...

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:32.900
Get a move on...!

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:36.370
Wait, stop pushing me so hard...!

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:42.170
Lief, do you have any fire beads left?

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:43.800
That one before was my last.

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:51.420
To think that it can pass
through such a narrow space...

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:54.280
If only we had blisters with us...

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:56.900
What are we supposed to do now?

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:06.290
Let's hide in that crevice for now!

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:13.800
Come with us if you don't
want to become its food.

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:14.800
R-Right...

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.220
The Glus can't see us.

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:41.980
So stay calm and don't move.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:44.620
As still as a stone, right?

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.110
Barda...!!

00:07:59.110 --> 00:08:01.440
Sorry. I couldn't hold it in.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:02.800
Just don't move.

00:08:55.520 --> 00:08:56.930
Thank goodness...

00:08:57.420 --> 00:08:59.490
This really is getting tiring...

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:02.490
Especially considering we've
had no time to rest...

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:07.170
Sleepy, Lief?

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:08.300
Yeah...

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:12.100
Please... Just let me rest for a bit...

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:18.910
Lief! Look!

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:30.200
So those who rest in this place
will sleep for the eternity, then...

00:09:30.760 --> 00:09:32.000
What in the world...

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:34.900
What's that sound...?

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:48.410
I wonder how long this would have taken
to harden if we didn't wake up...

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:55.360
So people running from the Glus entered this crevice hoping to get some rest...

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:59.230
And they wound up sleeping for eternity...

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:04.610
So we can't even rest much less
sleep in these caves, then?

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:11.410
Get me out of here!!

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:12.800
Milne!

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:30.820
That's right... I must be the one to
survive, no matter what it takes...!

00:10:30.820 --> 00:10:35.000
While those guys are being attacked by
the Glus, I need to search for the exit!

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:53.500
Milne...

00:12:17.350 --> 00:12:19.300
The Belt is hot again!

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:23.620
The gem must be somewhere nearby!

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:28.920
Somewhere around here...

00:12:31.010 --> 00:12:32.100
Lief!

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:33.630
Look over there!

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:41.140
There it is! That's the amethyst!

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:44.840
But how are we going to get to it?

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:48.040
It seems too difficult to climb that.

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:53.020
Our only option is to destroy that pillar, then.

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:54.580
Destroy it?

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:55.860
But how?!

00:12:56.360 --> 00:12:58.300
We'll have the Glus do the job.

00:12:58.810 --> 00:13:01.100
Jasmine, lend Barda your dagger.

00:13:02.390 --> 00:13:04.330
I'll be the decoy this time.

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:09.100
So use that chance to hack
away at the base of that pillar.

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:10.540
Got it!

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:15.700
Hey!

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:19.720
Over here! Hey you!

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:21.510
Over here!

00:13:22.590 --> 00:13:23.890
Come on!

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:25.300
I'm over here!

00:13:35.340 --> 00:13:36.680
Over here!

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:40.210
Will Lief really be okay...?

00:13:40.990 --> 00:13:44.420
Not even Lief will be able
to continue dodging forever.

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:47.800
He'll eventually tire, and when that happens...

00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:49.670
I'm going to help him!

00:13:56.910 --> 00:14:00.010
Over here! Come this way!

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:02.120
Jasmine!

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:05.580
Here! I'm over here, come this way!

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:07.500
Over here!

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:09.500
I'm over here!

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:21.360
That's enough, Jasmine!

00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:22.660
Now for the last part!

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:51.300
Lief!

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:06.070
At this rate, we'll be crushed by the rubble before the Glus gets to us!

00:15:14.170 --> 00:15:16.980
Lend me your strength, amethyst...!

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:23.680
<i>The symbol of truth, the amethyst.</i>

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:27.610
<i>The gem's shine is said to soothe
the mind of its wielder.</i>

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:34.480
Wind...?

00:15:35.020 --> 00:15:37.100
There's wind blowing somewhere nearby!

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:43.500
This wind... It has the scent of salt!

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:53.520
Alright, we can get through!

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:01.410
Hurry up, Barda!

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:02.810
It's too narrow...!

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:05.000
Pull him through...!

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:27.200
What is this place?

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:32.700
Jasmine!

00:16:35.960 --> 00:16:38.210
Sea water is flowing into this place.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:41.000
There's a wave coming! Hold on tight!

00:16:53.060 --> 00:16:55.300
The water level is rising!

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:59.450
So the sea water is going
to flood this cavern, then?

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:11.030
This place... We've seen it before!

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:22.120
We're inside of that blowhole!

00:17:22.380 --> 00:17:27.700
Then when a big wave comes, the sea water that's
trapped in here is sure to burst right out!

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:32.630
We need to get out of here, quick!

00:17:33.840 --> 00:17:35.920
Now! We can use the wave to propel us!

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:38.490
Barda!

00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:45.210
Keep your hands steady.

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:47.700
Go!

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:52.580
Good! Now hold on tight!

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:06.620
Lief!

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:09.610
Get a hold of yourself!!

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:14.010
Don't give up, Lief! The wave has
almost reached the cavern!

00:18:32.580 --> 00:18:33.440
Lief...!

00:18:49.990 --> 00:18:51.300
We did it...

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:53.970
We really escaped the Maze of the Beast!

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:57.900
And we also got the amethyst.

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:09.890
Kree!

00:19:12.940 --> 00:19:15.000
W-What the hell are you lot doing here?!

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:19.660
How in the world did you get out of there?!

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:31.800
Now this is a surprise. To think someone could survive after meeting the Glus...

00:19:34.220 --> 00:19:35.100
Knock it off!

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:41.350
I won't be letting you have that.

00:19:46.100 --> 00:19:47.120
What?!

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:50.400
Good going, Polipan!

00:19:50.400 --> 00:19:52.000
Here's a caramel candy!

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:12.790
You're not half bad for a boy!

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:17.520
Lief!

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:35.860
Lief...!

00:20:42.980 --> 00:20:44.580
Where is Dain?

00:20:44.580 --> 00:20:48.300
We already handed that guy
over to the Grey Guards.

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:50.940
As for what's become of
him now, who could say?

00:20:50.940 --> 00:20:53.410
Let's get going! We have to rescue Dain!

00:20:54.030 --> 00:20:55.050
Yes, we shall.

00:20:55.590 --> 00:20:59.760
But first of all, we need to get our
belongings back from their hideout.

00:20:59.760 --> 00:21:00.480
Hey!

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:03.560
You're not going to kill us?

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:10.200
The goal of our journey is not to kill people.

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:14.400
It is to save them; to save
the Kingdom of Deltora.

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:19.400
So wait here until we gather
all of our belongings.

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:29.460
The Belt has taught me that as
long as we never give up,

00:21:29.460 --> 00:21:32.500
we will always find a way forward.

00:21:40.050 --> 00:21:44.400
<i>And thus, Lief successfully acquired
the sixth gem, the amethyst.</i>

00:21:46.520 --> 00:21:47.890
This makes six.

00:21:47.890 --> 00:21:49.200
There's just one left!

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:49.900
Yeah.

00:21:54.640 --> 00:21:55.610
It's the polipan!

00:21:56.200 --> 00:21:57.710
He's brought our weapons!

00:22:04.590 --> 00:22:06.160
And our other belongings as well!

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:15.810
W-What are they doing?

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:17.810
They want their reward, don't they?

00:22:17.810 --> 00:22:21.610
And they probably won't let you go until they get their caramel candy.

00:22:22.180 --> 00:22:26.080
What?! But I don't have
anymore caramel candy!

00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:07.680
<i>The Glus.</i>

00:24:08.940 --> 00:24:11.570
<i>A giant slug-like monster.</i>

00:24:11.570 --> 00:24:16.940
<i>It has two feelers on its head, and uses
white globs of thread to capture its prey.</i>

00:24:16.940 --> 00:24:19.420
<i>It can even pass through narrow passages.</i>

00:24:20.420 --> 00:24:22.400
Thaegan has revived!

00:24:22.400 --> 00:24:26.000
And once again, she attacked us together with her monstrous children!

00:24:26.530 --> 00:24:30.930
What fate awaits us after being
captured by their giant spider?!

00:24:30.820 --> 00:24:34.690
Sorceress Thaegan Strikes Back

00:24:31.810 --> 00:24:34.690
Next time, 'Sorceress Thaegan Strikes Back'.

00:24:49.730 --> 00:24:54.800
See you next time
